==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Trevenant|7}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion; both cards have the Horn Leech attack.
*{{m|Horn Leech}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Trevenant}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

